{
    "title": "Bike Stunt Dirt Bike Games",
    "description": "Bike Stunt Impossible Offroad Tracks Race is the No.1 stunt bike game with insane stunt actions!The most addictive physics based Real Stunt Bike Game of 2020. \r\n\r\nYou will be driving through a variety of treacherous tracks, while enjoying the realistic bike physics and fast-paced gameplay. Contest in real bike stunt championship multiplayer mode and become the champion of bike games. Bike stunt offroad tracks race is the ultimate free mobile game available on play store. It is available with upgraded bikes and crazy riders. Make the most out of our game and become the pioneer of racing games. On popular user demand Bike stunt game now comes with localized languages.\r\n\r\nPerform The Bset Stunt:\r\nDominate the arena of bike race by performing stunts in racing 3D game. Bike race game made special with unique stunts and challenges in racing games. Become one of the best mobile game users who can perform unique stunts. Put on the helmet, start your motorcycle and become a part of this bike race game adventure. Helmet is crucial and decides your fate in motor bike stunts, you will know it by the end of the game. \r\n\r\nIn-Game Garage:\r\nA garage full of stunt bikes awaits your arrival. You can unlock your favorite motorcycle though rewards in this bike race game. After playing some bike race missions your motorcycle must be upgraded to meet the ever increasing challenges. Increased speed, handling & up-gradation is essential. You can customize the outfit of your rider in this bike race game. Buy Helmet, gloves & costume of your rider in the motorcycle game garage.\r\n\r\nTough Challenges:\r\nAvoid the hurdles and obstacles to pave your path to greatness in bike games. Drive professionally and perform crazy moto stunts to become the perfect stuntman. Learn motorcycle driving tricks to complete the challenging tasks on time. \r\n\r\nBest Controls:\r\nBike Stunt game has the best bike controls along with realistic motocross physics. You will understand the true meaning of definitive gaming with this free game; the feeling of driving a real stunt bike in bike race game. Press the gas button to move your stunt bike, press break to avoid hitting any obstacles & jump button is also provided in this free game. Select your desired controls from the game settings in this free game.\r\n\r\nComplete each impossible mega ramp stunt level in order to unlock the next one. Use the several camera views for better experience to avoid the obstacles and fall downs from the top of the vertical moto bike race. Be perfect while taking the sharp and narrow turns and rush like a crazy bike stunt master. Tap the nitro button to boost up your Mega vertical ramp motorbike speed whenever you feel your speed it not enough. Try to get all three stars to upgrade your XP level. Download the Bike Stunt Impossible Offroad Tracks Race and become the real champion of extreme motor bike stunt driving. This is one of the best real ramp bike stunt game on store.\r\n\r\nA bike game that makes you forget about all car games, bike race games and other water games with simulation. Become a real stunt man of bike games with this water stunt game. Download Now and become a pro Bike Stuntman",
